			<Comment>♀
・アイテム入手後メッセージ
・swanで新規作成</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-24T03:17:03" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>FIGHTERW
格闘家♀</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
